WEBVTT - typo3-visual-editor (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.191
A typo on the page meant finding the record in the backend, opening its form and saving.

2
00:00:12.891 --> 00:00:15.464
You ask for editing on the page.

3
00:00:19.341 --> 00:00:26.276
The skill traces each output to its record and field; f:render.text makes it editable.

4
00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:34.026
In the Visual Editor: click the headline, type, save. The record is updated.

5
00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:39.634
Readiness is tested as an editor, never only as admin.

6
00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:44.120
Open source. Clone the skills.
